     1	# Announcement 04 — model_comparison.md is the living results table (2026-08-03)
     2	
     3	Yixun directive: maintain `worklog/worklog_yixun/model_comparison.md` as the cross-experiment model results table (both K, all six metrics, mean ± std over 5 eval seeds, full unseen split), and **on EVERY model-results update (new 5-seed block, new gate, new checkpoint of record): regenerate the table (`python3 worklog/worklog_yixun/gen_model_comparison.py`), commit, and push immediately.**
     4	
