    62	
    63	Training side composes without code changes; a data-side port is required because no commit carries both halves. `restrict_to_split` lives only on `exp-14-data-curve`; `yaw_aug` and `training.frame_avg_max_fwd_samples` only on `localization-exp`. Choice: cut from `localization-exp`, port exp_14's data side (`AR_md.py` byte copy — it was byte-identical at `7bbd8aa` and our base; `dataset.py` +7; data files byte copies).
