    66	
    67	B-F chunk plan (ann. 06): legacy per-angle = one ViT forward (one train-mode DINOv3 RoPE `(1,)` draw) per orbit angle. Default cap 64 at micro 32 → 2 angles per chunk ({90°,180°} share a draw). `frame_avg_max_fwd_samples` = per-rank micro → 1 angle per chunk = the loop's call structure; `drop_last=True` → no tail batch. Config `FLAC_AR_BF_cap32.json` = `FLAC_AR_BF.json` + exactly that key (`_cap8` only for the opt-in 8×8 rung). Proven by a seeded CPU training-mode test (§10 B4a) and observed on the GPU by the run-evidence callback (§10 B3: conditioner call shapes in the first step); CUDA bit identity not claimed.
