   132	
   133	Per cell (exp_25 / exp_35 argv shape, verified), with the worker count made explicit (Codex r2 NIT 4): **`--num-workers 4`** — the evaluator default every reference cell ran with (exp_14, exp_25, exp_35 pass none); the context draws, hence `input_hash`, depend on it:
   134	- YAW / P1: `--model-config <the run's training config> --dataset-config src/configs/dataset_configs/AR/eval/acousticroom_unseeneval{,_1}.json --cond-method vanilla --cond-autocast bf16 --cfg-scale 1.0 --steps 1 --batch-size 64 --num-workers 4 --device cuda --record-per-scene --record-stream --expected-stream-count 6337 --seed <S> --rotate-mode fixed --rotate-deg 0 --eval-name <run>_K<K>_s<S> --ckpt-path <farm link> --dump-scored-waveforms /media/diskstation/yixunhu/FLAC/exp38_pred_waveforms`
