   139	6 runs × K ∈ {8, 1} × seeds 42–46 = 60 cells (+10 bridge). Sequence per run: train → checkpoint admission → its 10 cells on both cards (two lanes) → collect + publish → next run's SMOKE_DDP. Outputs land beside a per-run farm symlink `outputs_FLAC/exp38_data_efficiency/eval/<run>/<ckpt name>` → NAS checkpoint.
