     1	"""exp_38 — the observe-only run-evidence callback (src/training/run_evidence.py) and its
     2	default-off ``--evidence-json`` flag (plan_data_efficiency.md r2 §10 B3).
     3	
     4	Contracts: (1) flag absent/empty -> no extra callback, so every existing recipe is
     5	unchanged; (2) the callback never changes numerics: its wrappers are pass-through and are
     6	removed after the first optimizer step; (3) the evidence records what the plan's start gate
     7	needs (state digest, Sobol + RNG digests, SyncBN / BatchNorm counts, non-reentrant ViT
     8	checkpoint wrappers, flash / SDPA calls in src.models.transformer, conditioner call shapes).
     9	"""
