     1	"""exp_38 B4a — at cap == per-rank batch, the batched C4 orbit IS the legacy per-angle loop that
     2	trained B-F 100 %, in TRAINING mode (plan_data_efficiency.md r2 §5, §10 B4a; announcement 06).
     3	
     4	Two independent, identical copies of the real B-F conditioner (DINOv3-S from the pinned HF cache,
     5	train mode, the config's non-reentrant ViT checkpointing, train-mode RoPE rescale 2.0) are run
     6	under the same seeded RNG: copy A through ``_orbit_average_loop`` (the reference loop kept in
     7	``yaw_rotation.py``), copy B through ``_orbit_average_batched(cap=B)`` — the training path with
     8	``training.frame_avg_max_fwd_samples = B``. Outputs, masks, post-forward and post-backward RNG
     9	states, the loss and every parameter gradient must be bit-identical, and every checkpoint call
    10	non-reentrant. CPU fp32; skipped when the DINOv3 snapshot is not cached.
    11	"""
    12	import json
    13	import math
    14	import os
    15	
    16	import pytest
    17	import torch
