     2	
     3	The audit's candidate pool must be AR_md's own candidate list (captured from the real
     4	``get_ir_and_location_for_other_sources``), its ordered target list ``get_audio_filenames``'s,
     5	and its failure modes (empty restricted pool, split file missing on disk) must be reported.
     6	"""
     7	import importlib.util
