     1	"""Observe-only run evidence for the first optimizer step (exp_38, plan_data_efficiency.md r2 §10 B3).
     2	
     3	Enabled ONLY by ``train.py --evidence-json <path>`` (default ``''`` -> no callback at all). On every
     4	rank it records, at fit start, what the run is about to train (a digest of the full wrapper
     5	``state_dict``, the timestep Sobol engine state, Python / NumPy / torch RNG digests, SyncBN vs
     6	BatchNorm module counts, non-reentrant ViT checkpoint wrappers, whether flash-attention is wired
     7	into ``src.models.transformer``), then — for the FIRST optimizer step only — counts, through
     8	pass-through wrappers, flash-attention and SDPA calls in ``src.models.transformer``,
     9	``torch.utils.checkpoint.checkpoint`` calls (with ``use_reentrant``) and the conditioner's call
    10	shapes ``(len(batch_metadata), only_ids)``. After step 1 it writes ``<path>.rank<r>.json`` and
    11	removes every wrapper. Nothing here draws a random number, moves a parameter or changes a value.
    12	"""
    13	import functools
    14	import hashlib
    15	import json
    16	import os
    17	import random
    18	
    19	import numpy as np
    20	import pytorch_lightning as pl
    21	import torch
